WEBVTT

00:02.460 --> 00:03.360
You're so noisy.

00:06.440 --> 00:07.820
THE SLEEPING LION RECEIVED
87.991.000.300.000.199 DAMAGE

00:12.070 --> 00:15.950
Geez. I'm still talking,
you small puppy.

00:22.500 --> 00:25.560
The tough opponent we faced
just got wiped out that easily...

00:26.460 --> 00:27.610
Huh?

00:27.610 --> 00:29.040
Something came out.

00:34.180 --> 00:34.930
That's...

00:34.930 --> 00:35.710
SAVE ITEM - LIONHEART
That's the save item!

00:35.710 --> 00:36.830
TO THE BRAVE WARRIORS,
That's the save item!

00:36.830 --> 00:38.180
YOU MAY RETURN TO THIS BATTLEFIELD AT ANY TIME
That's the save item!

00:43.230 --> 00:44.150
PLAYER NAME - ASLAN HIGHROLLS
DO YOU WANT TO SAVE IT?

00:44.590 --> 00:45.880
I see!

00:45.880 --> 00:48.510
We can return to the human world
with this item!

00:48.510 --> 00:49.260
Woah!

00:49.260 --> 00:50.550
- Finally!
- We can return this time!

00:50.550 --> 00:52.180
Why are you humans so happy?

00:52.920 --> 00:54.780
That item is only to save.

00:54.780 --> 00:58.780
It forces you to start the next dive
from where you left off in the game.

00:59.980 --> 01:02.610
I-It may be temporary,

01:02.610 --> 01:04.880
but if we can take our time,
we can conquer this...

01:04.880 --> 01:06.670
You haven't noticed it yet?

01:07.350 --> 01:09.890
This game never ends, does it?

01:09.890 --> 01:11.050
Huh?

01:17.590 --> 01:19.020
There is a bug in this game...

01:19.820 --> 01:22.440
...that prevents the story
from making progress.

01:52.430 --> 01:54.090
GODS' GAMES WE PLAY

01:55.470 --> 02:00.730
GODS' GAMES WE PLAY

02:54.610 --> 02:56.410
PLAYER.12:

02:56.410 --> 02:59.160
THE UNDERWORLD OF DEATH AND REBIRTH, RUSHEIMARE
W-What does that mean? A bug?

02:59.650 --> 03:03.540
Do you still remember the legend of
this labyrinth that Meep told us?

03:04.200 --> 03:08.400
Yes. I was shocked to hear
that god had died.

03:09.590 --> 03:11.990
And Meep also said
in the first explanation,

03:11.990 --> 03:15.420
"This game will be completed
when you beat the last boss."

03:16.460 --> 03:19.800
The gods' game is a battle
between gods and humans.

03:19.800 --> 03:22.770
In other words, the last boss
of this labyrinth is a god.

03:24.460 --> 03:27.330
But that god no longer exists.

03:27.330 --> 03:30.880
So the condition of defeating the last boss
to clear this game is unattainable.

03:31.360 --> 03:32.940
What?!

03:32.940 --> 03:37.280
What?! The long-cherished dream of mankind
is to conquer the gods' games!

03:37.280 --> 03:40.700
And now we're stuck in this game forever?!

03:40.700 --> 03:43.330
Is there such a heinous bug?!

03:43.330 --> 03:45.560
Please return to the real world

03:45.560 --> 03:48.270
and report this situation
to Chief Secretary Miranda.

03:48.830 --> 03:51.470
We will continue to challenge this labyrinth.

03:51.470 --> 03:52.460
Huh?

03:52.820 --> 03:55.000
What are we going to do
if there isn't a last boss?

03:55.000 --> 03:56.300
Do you have any strategies?

03:56.300 --> 03:57.720
No, not at all.

03:57.720 --> 03:58.720
What?!

03:58.720 --> 04:03.000
But first, we'll aim for
the deepest part of the labyrinth

04:03.000 --> 04:05.230
to confirm if the last boss is really dead.

04:06.020 --> 04:08.480
The higher the difficulty,
the more exciting it is.

04:08.480 --> 04:10.060
I have no objection.

04:10.060 --> 04:12.520
I-I'll do my best too!

04:12.520 --> 04:15.990
Okay. We'll be back again.

04:22.680 --> 04:25.500
Let's go!

04:27.830 --> 04:30.740
Now, let's get serious about
conquering this labyrinth.

04:30.740 --> 04:32.550
W-What is this?

04:42.020 --> 04:44.050
Congratulations!

04:45.310 --> 04:48.330
You have conquered the raid boss
with flying colors.

04:48.330 --> 04:50.690
That's what I'd like to say...

04:51.730 --> 04:53.400
A yellow card!

04:53.400 --> 04:57.220
The outside god shouldn't have
cleared an important event.

04:57.220 --> 04:59.070
That was because of that puppy!

04:59.070 --> 05:01.780
If you do the same thing again...

05:04.760 --> 05:06.490
Now, we're going into underworld mode.

05:06.490 --> 05:07.810
UNDERWORLD MODE
Now, we're going into underworld mode.

05:07.810 --> 05:08.940
UNDERWORLD MODE
Any idea what kind of change

05:08.940 --> 05:09.960
UNDERWORLD MODE
there is in this mode?

05:09.960 --> 05:12.220
You don't have to tell us!

05:12.220 --> 05:14.920
We can tell that
the difficulty level has increased.

05:14.920 --> 05:17.680
The color of the walls just changed
to change the atmosphere.

05:17.680 --> 05:19.420
It's not?!

05:19.420 --> 05:22.740
There are some differences
in the monsters that appear,

05:22.740 --> 05:25.740
but I think there's some kind
of error since you're going

05:25.740 --> 05:27.960
to get wiped out hundreds of times.

05:27.960 --> 05:29.860
Don't let it be an error!

05:29.860 --> 05:32.770
Please do your best to achieve a Clear!

05:33.540 --> 05:34.730
Why?

05:34.730 --> 05:36.520
- Break a leg!
- Why is he so confidently recommending

05:36.520 --> 05:38.130
- Break a leg!
- that we achieve a Clear?

05:38.130 --> 05:40.600
- Break a leg!
- This game is broken.

05:42.590 --> 05:43.800
Well, whatever.

05:44.310 --> 05:45.770
I'll just have to find out.

05:50.080 --> 05:50.870
Okay.

05:50.870 --> 05:53.220
Let me go first from here.

05:53.220 --> 05:54.580
Are you sure?

05:54.580 --> 05:57.700
My Arise is very good at evasion.

05:57.700 --> 05:59.910
Leave it to me to deal with traps.

06:11.440 --> 06:14.550
Uroboros... Err, just how long
are you going to...

06:14.550 --> 06:18.110
Wait! I, the undefeated one,
know everything!

06:18.520 --> 06:20.570
You want to play with me, right?

06:20.570 --> 06:24.090
Actually, I've prepared
a new game for you.

06:24.090 --> 06:27.530
It's so popular that you'll have
to wait 50 years for your turn,

06:27.530 --> 06:32.490
but if you want to play with me so badly,
I'll give you a special invitation.

06:32.490 --> 06:36.540
Well, it can't be helped
since I'm so popular.

06:36.540 --> 06:39.130
No, you're not that popular,
to be honest...

06:39.130 --> 06:43.260
I don't like to interfere
in other gods' games,

06:43.260 --> 06:44.810
but I'll go along with you.

06:44.810 --> 06:46.590
Let's finish this game!

06:46.590 --> 06:49.870
What? The undefeated god
is going to help us?

06:49.870 --> 06:52.980
Are you sure?
You just got a penalty a while ago.

06:52.980 --> 06:53.900
I don't care.

06:53.900 --> 06:55.010
Hey!

07:00.380 --> 07:01.950
Is something wrong?

07:03.560 --> 07:04.970
There's a switch here.

07:05.810 --> 07:07.680
Don't touch it carelessly.

07:07.680 --> 07:08.960
Touch.

07:11.330 --> 07:15.370
My eyes hurt!
This is pepper spray!

07:15.370 --> 07:16.290
Shh.

07:16.840 --> 07:17.830
Be quiet.

07:27.560 --> 07:29.640
I have a bad feeling about this.

07:44.860 --> 07:47.490
So cute!

07:48.560 --> 07:52.600
What an adorable face!
Is there such a cute enemy like this?!

07:53.950 --> 07:56.980
Let me touch you just a little...

08:00.470 --> 08:02.550
Ah, Pui Pui genie!

08:02.550 --> 08:05.410
We can't tell which one is the monster.

08:06.510 --> 08:07.770
Pearl, under!

08:07.770 --> 08:08.590
Huh?

08:10.540 --> 08:13.760
No way! The puff that was so cute...

08:13.760 --> 08:15.990
Is this the underworld mode?

08:17.700 --> 08:19.190
It doesn't hurt...

08:19.190 --> 08:20.940
What a miserable change.

08:21.260 --> 08:23.210
Can we get it back
to its original form?

08:24.320 --> 08:25.700
What's wrong, Puff?!

08:28.640 --> 08:30.530
You're so stinky, Nel!

08:30.530 --> 08:33.160
No! It's this gastric juice that stinks!

08:34.490 --> 08:35.870
It's going to puke again!

08:35.870 --> 08:37.090
So stinky!

08:37.090 --> 08:38.700
Leave it! Let's run!

08:39.080 --> 08:40.100
Yeah!

08:45.490 --> 08:47.510
Hey, what's that door?

08:48.240 --> 08:48.970
A treasure room?

08:48.970 --> 08:49.880
TREASURE ROOM
A treasure room?

08:49.880 --> 08:52.470
TREASURE ROOM
It's definitely the event room.

08:53.620 --> 08:55.930
Ah, we need a key.

08:56.310 --> 09:00.070
Maybe it's on the road
we just ran down.

09:00.070 --> 09:02.520
Maybe it's been dropped
by the monsters we encountered.

09:02.910 --> 09:04.540
Let's find it.

09:07.530 --> 09:10.300
Oh, are you the lost adventurers?

09:12.340 --> 09:13.980
I am an angel,

09:13.980 --> 09:19.330
Pisalisdet Prinket Humerigel Brilliant III.

09:19.330 --> 09:22.840
I am the most loving
and merciful angel in this labyrinth,

09:22.840 --> 09:26.420
and I have a reputation
for helping the lost.

09:26.420 --> 09:31.010
Oh? Since your name is long,
can I call you Angel Pizza Pudding?

09:31.010 --> 09:32.470
Sure thing.

09:32.470 --> 09:34.250
He just accepted it?!

09:34.250 --> 09:35.890
With such a terrible name?!

09:36.550 --> 09:39.880
The most loving and merciful angel
in the labyrinth...

09:39.880 --> 09:41.850
Apparently, there's no doubt about it.

09:41.850 --> 09:44.630
You're very lucky today.

09:45.170 --> 09:48.320
I'll grant you a wish.

09:48.320 --> 09:49.900
A-Are you sure?!

09:49.900 --> 09:52.610
Then give us the key to this door!

09:52.940 --> 09:54.650
Sure thing.

09:56.080 --> 09:57.160
Ugh...!

09:59.590 --> 10:02.060
What's wrong, Pizza Pudding?

10:02.060 --> 10:04.080
What a...

10:07.710 --> 10:09.260
...filthy!

10:09.260 --> 10:10.270
Huh?

10:11.010 --> 10:14.690
I will grant your wish!

10:14.690 --> 10:16.680
In other words, purification!

10:16.680 --> 10:20.860
May you be reborn with a beautiful soul!

10:24.140 --> 10:28.650
THE ANGEL'S PURIFYING LIGHT: PURIFY
THE TWO DEFILED PLAYERS WERE PERISHED

10:31.140 --> 10:34.410
Now, let the great adventure begin!

10:35.110 --> 10:38.120
GODS' GAMES WE PLAY

10:40.780 --> 10:42.360
So the trick is that if you're dirty,

10:42.360 --> 10:45.880
that angel gets mad and wipes us out.

10:46.270 --> 10:48.890
This is because Nel is stinky.

10:48.890 --> 10:52.590
You too! That was because of
two people who were dirty!

10:53.080 --> 10:57.730
By the way, Ouroboros got respawned
because she's a part of our team, huh?

10:57.730 --> 10:58.300
Huh?

10:59.240 --> 11:01.160
A member of the team?

11:01.160 --> 11:04.100
I am a member of the humans team?

11:07.110 --> 11:08.730
Well, it can't be helped.

11:08.730 --> 11:13.280
I'm a very rare god
who rarely joins the team,

11:13.280 --> 11:16.220
but I have to put up with it
because of the game system.

11:16.220 --> 11:17.780
Oh my!

11:17.780 --> 11:19.580
- Oh? There's one more thing
- You humans love me too much!

11:19.580 --> 11:21.620
- that must be conquered.
- You humans love me too much!

11:21.620 --> 11:25.080
Pressing the pepper button
on the trap gimmick

11:25.080 --> 11:28.480
has increased the release value by 0.1%.

11:28.860 --> 11:31.170
It's a really unimportant number.

11:31.600 --> 11:32.570
I understand.

11:32.570 --> 11:34.410
We have no questions for now.

11:34.410 --> 11:36.200
We're going for the second try.

11:37.130 --> 11:37.800
SECOND TRY

11:37.800 --> 11:40.100
SECOND TRY
It's kind of tricky when all the monsters

11:40.100 --> 11:42.150
have changed their nature
in underworld mode.

11:42.560 --> 11:44.980
When you are covered
in zombie Puff fluid,

11:44.980 --> 11:47.340
Angel Pizza Pudding gets furious.

11:47.810 --> 11:48.730
Ugh!

11:49.670 --> 11:51.860
Maybe that Pui Pui genie's bell

11:52.320 --> 11:54.790
is also a signal to call her friends.

11:56.660 --> 11:59.900
Yeah, I think the most important thing

11:59.900 --> 12:01.870
is to make sure that monster doesn't find us.

12:06.070 --> 12:07.680
I hear the sound of a waterfall.

12:12.210 --> 12:14.420
It's a real waterfall!

12:15.340 --> 12:16.880
Hey, Fay! Over there!

12:16.880 --> 12:17.880
Huh?

12:18.870 --> 12:20.320
Is that the treasure chest?

12:20.320 --> 12:23.850
Maybe there's a key
to opening the treasure room!

12:28.500 --> 12:29.810
I'll open it.

12:34.350 --> 12:37.280
Uh, what's this?

12:37.730 --> 12:38.710
Cloth?

12:40.310 --> 12:41.740
There's no mistaking it!

12:42.160 --> 12:43.270
It's a swimsuit!

12:43.270 --> 12:43.810
SWIMSUIT

12:43.810 --> 12:44.620
YOU CAN'T CRAFT IT
Huh?

12:44.620 --> 12:45.720
USE IT WHEN YOU GO TO THE WATERFALL

12:46.380 --> 12:49.090
And this oversized one...

12:49.090 --> 12:50.330
...is for you, Pearl!

12:50.330 --> 12:52.080
So cute!

12:52.080 --> 12:55.260
Wait, how is that possible?!

12:56.250 --> 13:00.300
Let's forget about
the just-for-fun area and move on.

13:02.220 --> 13:03.900
Oh, this...

13:04.320 --> 13:06.560
Heh! I knew it!

13:07.010 --> 13:09.980
Everyone, do not approach this painting!

13:09.980 --> 13:15.820
If you get too close, the killer apple
will surely fly through the canvas!

13:21.960 --> 13:22.690
Eh?

13:23.700 --> 13:24.840
You okay?

13:24.840 --> 13:26.480
Ouch...

13:26.480 --> 13:28.290
I thought we would respawn...

13:28.920 --> 13:33.500
It seems that the killer apple was also
affected by the underworld mode.

13:33.500 --> 13:36.070
Thank goodness it turned out
to be a rotten apple,

13:36.070 --> 13:39.480
just like Puff turned out
to be a zombie Puff.

13:40.240 --> 13:42.780
Oh, are you the lost adventurers?

13:43.470 --> 13:45.070
Pizza Pudding!

13:45.070 --> 13:51.440
Correct. Let me grant you
one wish that will help you.

13:51.440 --> 13:55.530
Umm... You said that before
and wiped us out in the end...

13:55.530 --> 13:56.900
Are you sure?

13:56.900 --> 13:58.360
Of course.

13:58.360 --> 14:02.320
Then, please tell us where the key is
to open the treasure room!

14:03.830 --> 14:06.930
What an easy wish!

14:06.930 --> 14:10.000
Well, then, let me grant your—

14:10.000 --> 14:13.140
Ah, I have a bad feeling about this.

14:13.140 --> 14:14.710
How filthy!

14:14.710 --> 14:18.170
B-But the Pui Pui genie
hasn't found us yet!

14:18.170 --> 14:20.330
And the zombie Puff's fluid...

14:23.880 --> 14:27.880
May you be reborn with a beautiful soul!

14:29.890 --> 14:31.130
THE ANGEL'S PURIFYING LIGHT: PURIFY
PEARL

14:31.130 --> 14:33.560
THE ONE WHOSE BACK OF HER HEAD
WAS DEFILED, PERISHED

14:34.340 --> 14:36.940
Just who did you call a defile?!

14:36.940 --> 14:41.150
That damn angel!
I will not forgive you!

14:41.150 --> 14:42.610
THIRD TRY

14:48.130 --> 14:50.110
Yeay! We did it!

14:50.110 --> 14:52.700
Now, where is the key
to the treasure room?

14:58.550 --> 14:59.630
Huh?

15:00.450 --> 15:04.090
Why? We've gone through
the painting zone,

15:04.090 --> 15:07.260
but we arrived here
without finding the key.

15:07.660 --> 15:10.350
Oh, are you the lost adventurers?

15:10.350 --> 15:12.050
Angel Pizza Pudding!

15:12.050 --> 15:13.160
Again?!

15:13.160 --> 15:16.310
No, we were not covered
in that gastric juice!

15:16.310 --> 15:18.220
Angel Pizza Pudding!

15:18.220 --> 15:20.880
You said you're the most loving angel, right?

15:20.880 --> 15:23.030
That you'll grant our wishes.

15:23.030 --> 15:24.570
That's right.

15:24.570 --> 15:28.970
But it's only for the ones
who are clean and innocent.

15:29.490 --> 15:33.610
By the looks of it,
it seems you're clean.

15:34.500 --> 15:39.210
I appreciate your cleanliness,
and I will grant your wishes.

15:39.210 --> 15:41.610
Then, the key to the treasure room...

15:41.610 --> 15:44.210
No, please open the door!

15:44.210 --> 15:45.800
Sure thing.

15:47.260 --> 15:48.430
Don't tell me...

15:48.430 --> 15:49.810
So stink...

15:49.810 --> 15:52.410
This rotten smell...

15:52.410 --> 15:55.830
You were covered in Zombie Puff's gastric
juices in your previous life, right?!

15:56.230 --> 15:57.790
And the stink of rotten apples too!

15:57.790 --> 16:00.250
W-Why?!

16:03.950 --> 16:06.900
This is a completely new pattern.

16:07.470 --> 16:09.380
Just like the player,

16:09.380 --> 16:12.520
I didn't expect to see a monster
that would take over the experience too.

16:13.080 --> 16:15.440
That smell is really troublesome.

16:15.440 --> 16:18.040
Okay, let's take our fourth try.

16:19.560 --> 16:20.750
Hmm? What's wrong?

16:23.710 --> 16:25.260
The smell...

16:25.640 --> 16:27.580
It's this gastric juice that stinks!

16:28.190 --> 16:29.960
This rotten smell...

16:29.960 --> 16:34.310
You were covered in Zombie Puff's gastric
juices in your previous life, right?!

16:35.760 --> 16:37.010
We can't get rid of it...

16:40.850 --> 16:43.820
I know how to open the treasure room!

16:43.820 --> 16:45.650
Speaking of smell...

16:45.650 --> 16:49.410
Hair is a woman's life!
It's our specialty!

16:49.410 --> 16:51.030
Which means...!

16:51.970 --> 16:54.060
That was the clue!

16:55.850 --> 16:56.950
I see!

16:57.330 --> 16:58.540
I'll join too!

16:59.490 --> 17:01.080
Umm...

17:01.570 --> 17:03.880
Just leave this matter to us.

17:04.340 --> 17:07.140
Fay, please wait in front
of the treasure room.

17:07.140 --> 17:09.790
We'll go finish the preparations!

17:09.790 --> 17:11.300
Preparations?

17:11.300 --> 17:12.890
Then, let's go.

17:12.890 --> 17:14.930
Yeah! Let's go!

17:17.730 --> 17:20.310
That's the best part of this dungeon.

17:20.620 --> 17:24.520
We're not looking for a level of difficulty
that you and I can conquer on our own.

17:24.520 --> 17:27.930
A game where the two of them can say,
"We'll take care of it,"

17:27.930 --> 17:29.550
will be a good game.

17:34.270 --> 17:35.700
Leshea is right.

17:36.200 --> 17:40.160
Maybe this is how
the gods' games should be played.

17:40.860 --> 17:45.190
Everyone on the team
has to use their wits to win.

17:47.960 --> 17:49.770
Sorry to keep you waiting, Master Fay.

17:49.770 --> 17:51.840
Have you done your preparations?

17:51.840 --> 17:54.210
Yes! Watch this!

17:55.210 --> 17:58.060
Come out! Angel Pizza Pudding!

18:00.220 --> 18:02.930
Are you calling me?

18:03.790 --> 18:04.780
Oh?

18:14.070 --> 18:16.570
You're so pure.

18:17.130 --> 18:19.150
Now, you may go on.

18:20.360 --> 18:21.460
Yay!

18:21.460 --> 18:22.800
Finally!

18:23.790 --> 18:25.950
You really did it.

18:25.950 --> 18:28.370
Would you mind sharing the tricks?

18:28.370 --> 18:31.730
That angel did not like dirty things.

18:33.010 --> 18:37.680
And the smell that got on us
didn't come off when we respawned.

18:37.680 --> 18:38.580
But...

18:38.930 --> 18:43.460
Do you think a maiden of our age would keep
quiet when someone mentioned our smell?

18:43.460 --> 18:44.900
Err...

18:44.900 --> 18:47.830
I'm a little sweaty.

18:47.830 --> 18:50.860
I'm also careful about choosing
deodorants and perfumes.

18:50.860 --> 18:54.430
I also choose treatments that smell good.

18:54.430 --> 18:57.820
But in the end,
the most effective thing is...

18:57.820 --> 18:59.280
Take a bath.

18:59.280 --> 19:00.290
Ah!

19:00.840 --> 19:02.270
Take a bath in that waterfall!

19:04.260 --> 19:06.830
That waterfall would wash off the smell.

19:07.290 --> 19:09.540
In other words,
the swimsuit in the treasure chest

19:09.920 --> 19:11.770
was the key to conquering the game.

19:12.270 --> 19:13.330
It's just...

19:13.330 --> 19:17.850
We were supposed to be there just to get
rid of the smell, but we got carried away.

19:27.190 --> 19:30.150
UNDEFEATED

19:30.970 --> 19:32.590
It's a great discovery!

19:45.120 --> 19:46.470
Take this!

19:46.470 --> 19:48.110
How dare you!

20:21.370 --> 20:22.110
Ah...

20:23.030 --> 20:25.000
A-Anyway!

20:25.000 --> 20:28.110
What do you think?
Were we useful for this team?

20:30.470 --> 20:31.670
Fay?

20:31.670 --> 20:32.820
Of course.

20:35.120 --> 20:36.840
Thanks to you both,
Pearl and Nel.

20:37.170 --> 20:39.090
You're both really helpful.

20:49.570 --> 20:52.100
Wow! Jewels everywhere!

20:52.100 --> 20:54.570
What a stunning room!

20:55.960 --> 20:57.280
Hey, look!

21:01.950 --> 21:03.230
ITEM: TREASURE ROOM'S MASTER KEY

21:03.230 --> 21:04.090
THE NUMBER OF ITEMS IN YOUR POSSESSION

21:04.090 --> 21:04.960
HAS INCREASED FROM 2 TO 100.

21:04.960 --> 21:05.780
IN ADDITION, YOU WILL NOT LOSE ANY ITEMS,

21:05.780 --> 21:06.450
EVEN IF YOU ARE WIPED OUT.

21:08.400 --> 21:10.040
So the upper limit has been released,

21:10.040 --> 21:13.670
and now we can have more
powerful items than ever before.

21:14.130 --> 21:18.710
Congratulations!
At last, the last boss is here!

21:21.040 --> 21:24.640
Let me guide you there!

21:29.540 --> 21:34.480
Why from a falling pit?!

21:37.280 --> 21:39.400
MAL-RA BRANCH OFFICE OF THE ARCANE COURT
We're going

21:39.400 --> 21:41.130
to that labyrinth as the rescue team

21:41.130 --> 21:43.450
from this branch soon.

21:43.860 --> 21:45.830
Good job, Kelritch.

21:51.540 --> 21:55.980
Fay, we are truly destined to meet again.

21:56.500 --> 22:00.720
We'll meet again in that labyrinth.

22:01.120 --> 22:04.180
You're going to meet him,
and you call that destiny?

22:05.100 --> 22:07.140
Wait for me, Fay!

22:07.140 --> 22:08.780
I'll join in the game too!
